<title>USA: CCC buys 30,000 tonnes U.S. HRW wheat for Bosnia.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 30,000 tonnes U.S. HRW wheat for Bosnia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it bought 30,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat for donation to Bosnia.</p>
<p>The wheat was bought from Farmland Industries Inc at $176.74 a tonne, FOB Galveston, Texas.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for January 25-February 20.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
